  "body": "![Husk&Camel](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ef1afbedea91beb11a6285039be214d18b97f334.webp)\n\n\n## About\nA resource pack for the **Soft Imprints** mod that provides imprint textures\nin the Faithful 32x style. <br> \nThere are **Sand**, **Red Sand**, and **Snow** imprints here.\n\n## Requirements\n- [Soft Imprints](https://modrinth.com/mod/snow-imprints)\n- [Faithful 32x](https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/faithful-32x) (optional)\n\n## Credits\n- Faithful: https://faithfulpack.net/\n- Imprint Textures are licensed under the [Faithful License](https://faithfulpack.net/license)\n\n## More screenshots\n\n<details>\n<summary>In-game view and Config Screen</summary>\n\n![Settings x32](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/020e2394c97502c482aebffb821301bdf0a75473.webp)\n\n![Sheep](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5299e0cb18759f0e03004790453e53186239d061.webp)\n\n</details>\n\n",
